This repository contains a patch (patches/week1-vortex-f53bc48.patch) that
modifies source files of Vortex GPGPU:

  https://github.com/vortexgpgpu/vortex
  Copyright © 2019-2023 the Vortex authors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The modified files are:
  sim/simx/dxa/dxa_core.cpp
  sim/simx/tcu/tcu_tbuf.cpp
  sim/simx/tcu/tcu_tbuf.h
  sim/simx/tcu/tcu_unit.cpp

Every change is enclosed in #ifdef VX_CFG_DXA_SCATTER_COALESCE or
#ifdef VX_CFG_TCU_TBUF_PREFETCH (changes made in November 2026), so with
both flags off the files behave exactly as upstream.

The logs under runs/ are outputs of Vortex's own test programs, run on
Vortex built from the commit above, with and without the patch.
